        The bug was caused by the `SolrQueryParser` class parsing the SolrConfig DOM tree on each instantiation, which led to significant performance slowdowns due to the repeated overhead of this parsing operation. This inefficiency was particularly problematic in scenarios where multiple instances of `SolrQueryParser` were created, as it unnecessarily increased the processing time.

        Commit message:
        SOLR-2493: SolrQueryParser was fixed to not parse the
 SolrConfig DOM tree on each instantiation which is a huge slowdown

